changelog	Format: [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/), versioning: [SemVer](https://semver.org/). The file format has its own version (`%KAPU 1.2`, see `SPEC-KAPU.md`); the tools below are versioned separately. Specification v1.2.2; the file format stays 1.2. Phases 1 to 3 of plan v2: every ranking change was measured as a switch on a fixed dev/test split of the questions, and only what passed the M0 rule became a default (`bench/RESULTS.md` chapter 12, `bench/results/2026-10-27-plan-v2.json`). - The README starts with a 30-second quickstart (install, pack, connect), then a short before-and-after of the measurements; the full benchmark tables are folded, and how it works and the desktop window come before	kapu, py, tools, file, room, line, kubernetes docs, results
